/* DoL-MP v1.2.0-dev9: mp-job-seasonal-and-failures-3.twee (20 passages: 12 Job Extra 2 + 8 Job Partner 3) */

:: MP Job Extra Cafe 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>窗外冷雨淅沥，海风咖啡馆里挤满避雨客人，<<else>>午后茶点高峰期的海风咖啡馆内，<</if>>一只装满热焦糖浆的玻璃壶底座突然出现裂纹，甜腻糖浆正往木吧台边缘渗流。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回班次岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_cafe_2 is 1>>
咖啡馆吧台上的焦糖浆已换入新瓷罐，台面擦拭得清爽光洁。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-extra-cafe-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "端起温水盆接住渗漏糖浆 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-cafe-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_cafe_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_extra_cafe_2")>><<money 380>><</if>>你迅速用温水盆托住裂壶并将糖浆转入备用瓷罐，格威岚在吧台后冲你赞许颔首。<span class="green">你及时保住了整罐焦糖浆与吧台整洁。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续完成今日班次 (0:04)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	温热糖浆粘在手指上，烫得你指尖微红。<span class="red">你先用冷水冲净手指糖渍。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦净手心重新上手 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Cafe 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回岗位歇口气 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用厚餐巾裹壶分装热糖浆 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-cafe-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_cafe_2 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpJob3_mp_job_extra_cafe_2_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_extra_cafe_2")>><<money 380>><</if>>几只小奶盅刚好盛满焦糖，还顺手送上了客人的松饼桌，赢来一笔额外小费。<span class="green">急中生智的分装赢得了满堂称赞。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去查看手艺近况 (0:04)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	餐巾边角沾了糖浆，拉扯时差点带翻汤匙。<span class="red">你扶稳汤匙准备换块干布再分装。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放稳呼吸再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Cafe 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回班次岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Extra Fish 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.season is "winter" or Weather.isFreezing>>寒潮来袭的鱼档结了一层薄霜，<<else>>早市卸货高峰期的栈桥鱼档上，<</if>>碎冰机齿轮被一块硬冰卡死，刚上岸的一批鲜银鲳急需铺冰保鲜。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回班次岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_fish_2 is 1>>
鱼档碎冰机的齿轮今日已疏通完毕，细碎冰花均匀覆在银鲳上。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-extra-fish-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用铁冰锥凿碎卡齿的硬冰块 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-fish-2">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_fish_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_extra_fish_2")>><<money 380>><</if>>硬冰应声碎裂，碎冰机轰鸣着吐出雪白冰花，老渔工分给你几枚鲜鱼提成。<span class="green">你利落凿通碎冰机保住了整批银鲳。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续完成今日班次 (0:04)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	飞溅的冰碴擦过手背，冻得皮肤生疼。<span class="red">你戴好厚棉手套准备再凿。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦净手心重新上手 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Fish 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回岗位歇口气 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "淋上温盐水化冰再摇手柄 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-fish-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_extra_fish_2 to 1>><<set $mpClues["mpJob3_mp_job_extra_fish_2_alt"] to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_extra_fish_2")>><<money 380>><</if>>盐水迅速融开卡死处，齿轮顺滑转动起来，银鲳及时铺满了碎冰。<span class="green">你用温盐水巧解了碎冰机卡阻。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去查看手艺近况 (0:04)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	盐水浇偏了半寸，手柄依然沉重难摇。<span class="red">你对准主齿缝隙准备再淋一次。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放稳呼吸再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Fish 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回班次岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

