	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_extra_spa_2")>><<money 380>><</if>>备用进水阀稳住了池水温度，你从容拆下主滤网刷得干干净净。<span class="green">双路切换让药浴池水温分毫未降。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去查看手艺近况 (0:04)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	备用铜阀旋钮滑腻，拧动时脱了一下手。<span class="red">你裹上干毛巾准备重新旋阀。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
